{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act36side_level_act36side_02_beg",
  "groupId": "act36side",
  "stageId": "act36side_02",
  "title": "雨林解毒燉湯",
  "storyCode": "DT-2",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act36side/level_act36side_02_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b65f822e82ecbbc94884e96bb24d4836feb2295a48ec793e48b9a708bca85f01",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_jungle_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萊歐斯，快點跟上了啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快來看這顆蘑菇！迷宮裡最大的走路菇都沒有這麼大吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是走路菇長得這麼大該有多威風啊……等一下的午飯可以考慮吃它嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你小心一點啊，美食指南裡說叢林裡面的蘑菇多多少少都有一些毒性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比如吃了之後會全身起疹子，會導致血液凝固，會不斷嘔吐直到把內臟都吐出來之類的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……不敢想像寫下這本指南的人都經歷了什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老夫只跟著獸人學了分辨迷宮蘑菇的方法，這些沒見過的還是不要輕易嘗試了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是這邊有動物把這種厚厚的蘑菇當作食物！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行，如果只有一兩種動物在吃，那麼這種植物對大部分動物可能都有毒性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "換句話說，如果很多動物都在吃，那麼它才有可能是沒有毒性的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（低沉的咆哮）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼聲音？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（尖銳的蜂鳴）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有什麼東西往這邊飛來了！大家小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯小隊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_jungle_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1429_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（東敲敲，西敲敲）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1429_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇！剛才那一發炸得真猛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1429_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幸好找了沒人的測試場地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1429_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看看……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1429_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "膛壓，爆表。溫度，爆表。裝載量，也爆表！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1429_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來還是要火力大才好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1429_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "接下來就是最後調整一下剛才的配置，鬆鬆皮帶，鎖緊螺絲就完成了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1429_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要不出什麼意外，我的最新力作“無敵的酷東西”就可以開出去了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1429_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，要快點先把易爆品都拆掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1429_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "遠離明火，安全第一~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1429_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（東敲敲，西敲敲）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_jungle_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳……那邊有東西一直在爆炸……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瑪露希爾，你沒事吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我還好！只是，有點頭暈……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（低沉的咆哮）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼還有……！小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是魔像嗎？還是石像鬼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看我用魔法——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "轟隆——！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大祭司，大祭司，你在這裡嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "……什麼聲音？\n——嗚哇！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鱷魚！還是長著鱷魚頭的獸人？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鱷魚頭獸人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？獸人是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還說話了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鱷魚頭獸人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會說話很奇怪嗎？——喂，那邊那兩個杜林，你們是從地下剛爬上來的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“杜林”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "叫我們嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鱷魚頭獸人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "除了你們兩個矮個子還有誰長得像杜林？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也就是說，在他眼裡，我和奇爾查克是同一個種族？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡沒有“半身人”這樣的說法嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鱷魚頭獸人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……什麼亂七八糟的，你們這群人應該是有點毛病。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鱷魚頭獸人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，你們有沒有在這裡看到我們的大祭司？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大祭司？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鱷魚頭獸人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一個老頭，比我矮一點，戴個眼鏡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他為什麼會出現在這麼危險的地方？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鱷魚頭獸人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大祭司的想法一向很神秘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我們一路過來，沒見過這樣的老者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鱷魚頭獸人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大祭司的行蹤的確也很神秘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鱷魚頭獸人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然這樣，我還是回部落裡去好了，反正每次出來找他都是這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鱷魚頭獸人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再見，奇怪的遊客！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等！請問，你聽說過羅德島嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鱷魚頭獸人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘖嘖，你們算是幸運又有點不幸運。因為我好像聽過，又好像沒聽過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鱷魚頭獸人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我肯定，部落裡有人知道這個什麼島在哪裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鱷魚頭獸人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是這個人……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不會就是大祭司吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鱷魚頭獸人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你猜對了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鱷魚頭獸人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不然這樣，你們和我回部落裡，通常我們出去找大祭司，總會找不到，但大祭司過一下子自己就回來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_village"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聰明的鱷魚頭獸人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也就是說，你們之前在一座島上，上面有個大迷宮，你們走著走著就到這裡來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "差不多就是這樣，您知道些什麼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聰明的鱷魚頭獸人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯……島是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？就是……海上的陸地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聰明的鱷魚頭獸人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "海是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃……就是有很多水的地方？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聰明的鱷魚頭獸人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那不是湖嗎？你說話好奇怪喔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，因為這裡是內陸嗎……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聰明的鱷魚頭獸人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是你的問題太奇怪了！我從沒聽過什麼海啊，島啊，叫梅利尼的村子啊，你們該不會是被人一尾巴從泰拉的另一邊掃過來的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "泰拉……是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聰明的鱷魚頭獸人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是這裡啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "瑪露希爾試圖從眼前的鱷魚人的眼神中找到他在耍自己的痕跡。\n可惜，在那直率的眼神中，只有“這人該不會是個笨蛋吧？”這樣一個訊息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_village"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總之就是，這群鱷……阿達克利斯裡說得上話的是大祭司，瑪露希爾剛剛炸壞的魔像就是他的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_071",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "機甲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“無敵的酷東西”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們弄壞了他的“機甲”，他會願意幫我們找羅德島嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_071",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有關係，就算沒有你們，那台機甲終究也會爆炸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就沒有不爆炸的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聰明的阿達克利斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大祭司很隨和的，只要等他回來跟他說明情況，想必他不會怪罪你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聰明的阿達克利斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大祭司也很仗義，看到你們在這裡迷路，他絕對不會見死不救。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聰明的阿達克利斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這就是我們的大祭司！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "話雖是這麼說，但我們也要想個辦法賠禮道歉才好……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聰明的阿達克利斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用在意啦——什麼味道這麼香，話說今天輪到誰做飯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_071",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是那個大鬍子杜林在做飯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_jungle_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "泰拉、阿卡胡拉、活畫、迷宮……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗚……不行，完全理不出頭緒……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "魔法在這裡也可以使用，這就說明在法則上是有共通之處的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "法琳，要是你還在的話，我一定會像萊歐斯那樣，對正在發生的這一切興致勃勃吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，真想念我們一起在學校學習的日子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那時候……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦，這些小鳥吃的這個果子……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和那時候法琳給我吃的果子好像……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_village"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_071",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好香啊，杜林做飯的手藝也這麼好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老夫不是杜林……唉，就當老夫是杜林吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_071",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快叫兄弟們都來嚐嚐大鬍子杜林的手藝！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，你們剛才說要去找大祭司？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，我們想要向他請教一些問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_071",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也對，大祭司是這裡最聰明的人，但要見他沒那麼容易。要是他想見你們，你們就能見到他；要是他不願意，你們是一定見不到他的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這倒是很符合智者的做派……那怎麼樣才能讓他想見我們呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯……祖瑪瑪大姐交代過，要是我們想借用大祭司的智慧，就得搞出點熱鬧的動靜！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "先西",
      "speakerId": "avg_4143_sensi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "熱鬧的動靜……一頓大餐算嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "差不多吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒意見，問問瑪露希爾的想法吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊歐斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_4142_laios_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這麼說起來，瑪露希爾呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇爾查克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4144_chilc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她還沒回來嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪露希爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4141_marcil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可惡的炎龍，把法琳還給我！！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
